; Corpus fs-t0.3-a0-r1.0-dz0 with its thresholds between ink's read and the truth.
; A fin 20 x 4 x 0.3 mm along x from a 4 x 6 x 6 block, held at x < 1, E 200 GPa, nu 0, 1e-5 N at its tip (x > 19),
; mid-plane at z 0; yield 250 MPa. 1 mm cells: the fin splits to 0.125 mm, resolved (0.3 >= two of them).
; Its faces (z +-0.15) lie in split cells 0.2 full; a surface read there falls back half a *grid* cell (0.5 mm) inward, into air.
; truth: strong fails at least 0.002417 (beam, 6 M / b t^2 1 mm from the root; the root's concave corner only raises it)
; truth: safe fails at most 1.034e+05 (yield 250 over that beam stress)
(import "std") (def part (min (move (box 4 6 6) 2 0 0) (move (box 20 4 0.3) 10.0 0 0)))
(study s (shape part) (elastic (E 200000MPa) (nu 0) (yield 250MPa)) (fix root (- x 1)) (load tip (force 0 0 -1e-05N) (region (- 19 x))) (res 1))
(require strong (max-stress s < 0.002MPa))
(require safe (min-safety-factor s > 125000))
